            "invisible": false,
            "solution": ""
          },
          {
            "x": 2.178649237472767,
            "y": 12.910611231371064,
            "width": 92.73743016759778,
            "height": 86.09271523178808,
            "action": {
              "library": "H5P.AdvancedText 1.1",
              "params": {
                "text": "<p><strong>The Origins of the Middle East Conflict</strong><br>\nThe Middle East conflict has a long history that spans many decades. It mainly arose from territorial differences and political disagreements between various states and groups in the region. Particularly, the dispute over the land between Israelis and Palestinians is at the center of the conflict. The founding of the state of Israel in 1948 was a significant trigger for the ongoing disputes.</p>\n\n<p><strong>International News as a Source of Information</strong><br>\nInternational news plays a crucial role in informing people worldwide about developments in the Middle East conflict. They report on political decisions, military actions, and humanitarian crises in the region. Through the reporting, people outside the conflict can understand what is happening locally and form an opinion.</p>\n\n<p><strong>Influence of Reporting on Public Opinion</strong><br>\nThe way international news reports on the Middle East conflict can significantly influence public opinion. It can evoke empathy for the victims or also strengthen political stances. The portrayal of events in the media can also lead to misunderstandings and prejudice.</p>\n"
              },
              "metadata": {
                "contentType": "Text",
                "license": "U",
                "title": "Unbenannt: Text",
                "defaultLanguage": "en"
              },
              "subContentId": "53bc5361-5ce5-43a9-a00f-57bbceee9cd0"
            },
            "alwaysDisplayComments": false,
            "backgroundOpacity": 0,
            "displayAsButton": false,
            "buttonSize": "big",
            "goToSlideType": "specified",
            "invisible": false,
            "solution": ""
          }
        ],
