          {
            "x": 2.23463687150838,
            "y": 13.245033112582782,
            "width": 92.73743016759778,
            "height": 86.09271523178808,
            "action": {
              "library": "H5P.AdvancedText 1.1",
              "params": {
                "text": "<p><strong>The Importance of Independent Media</strong><br>\nIndependent media are important to ensure balanced reporting on the Middle East conflict. They help to present various perspectives and understand the complexity of the conflict. Independent reporting can contribute to education and promote debate on possible solutions.</p>\n\n<p><strong>Challenges of Reporting</strong><br>\nReporting on the Middle East conflict is often fraught with challenges. Journalists may be restricted in their work due to the dangerous situation on the ground or political constraints. Also, the complex geopolitical relationships can influence the portrayal of events.</p>\n\n<p><strong>The Future of Reporting on the Middle East Conflict</strong><br>\nThe reporting on the Middle East conflict is likely to evolve over time. New media platforms and journalistic approaches can contribute to a deeper understanding of the conflict and help initiate constructive discussions on solutions.</p>\n"
              },
              "metadata": {
                "contentType": "Text",
